@startuml
title Order lifecycle (mirrors the table in OrderWorkflow)
[*] --> CREATED : createOrder
CREATED --> CREATED : addPancake / addIngredientToPancake / removePancakes
CREATED --> COMPLETED : completeOrder (Disciple)\n(not empty, every pancake has ingredients)
CREATED --> CANCELLED : cancelOrder (Disciple, removed)
COMPLETED --> PREPARED : prepareOrder (Chef)
PREPARED --> DELIVERED : deliverOrder (Delivery, removed)
CANCELLED --> [*]
DELIVERED --> [*]
@enduml
